      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "最近啊……總是會被野生的獨角蟲\n大口大口地啃掉庭園裡的樹木……<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕļ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 1,
      "offsetInSection": 216,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "67008FD1554A202620267E3D662F670388AB91CE751F7684736889D287F2000A592753E3592753E35730554363895EAD571288E176846A39672820262026001000020114013C0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 36
    },
    {
      "displayText": "而且裡面還有隻\n大得可笑的頭目獨角蟲，<U+0010><U+0001>븀\n我已經趕牠趕了好多次了……<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕļ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 2,
      "offsetInSection": 288,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "800C4E1488E197629084670996BB000A59275F9753EF7B117684982D76EE736889D287F2FF0C00100001BE00000A62115DF27D938D9572608D954E86597D591A6B214E8620262026001000020114013C0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 41
    },
    {
      "displayText": "難道是庭園裡的樹木\n我都整理得太棒了？<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕļ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 3,
      "offsetInSection": 372,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "96E39053662F5EAD571288E176846A396728000A621190FD657474065F97592A68D24E86FF1F001000020114013C0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 24
    },
    {
      "displayText": "但說不定不需要用趕的，\n只需要把頭目獨角蟲給捉起來，<U+0010><U+0001>븀\n其他的獨角蟲就不會過來了。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕļ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 4,
      "offsetInSection": 420,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "4F468AAA4E0D5B9A4E0D9700898175288D957684FF0C000A53EA97008981628A982D76EE736889D287F27D6663498D774F86FF0C00100001BE00000A51764ED67684736889D287F25C314E0D6703904E4F864E863002001000020114013C0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 48
    },
    {
      "displayText": "求求<U+0010><U+0003>ᄀÿā你妳！幫我把那隻在白天出現的\n頭目獨角蟲給捉起來吧！！<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕļ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 5,
      "offsetInSection": 516,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "6C426C4200100003110000FF01014F6059B3FF015E6B6211628A90A396BB5728767D592951FA73FE7684000A982D76EE736889D287F27D6663498D774F865427FF01FF01001000020114013C0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 39
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿<U+0006>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 6,
      "offsetInSection": 596,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF00060000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "獨俏喔！！",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 7,
      "offsetInSection": 608,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "73684FCF5594FF01FF010000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 6
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿<U+0008>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 8,
      "offsetInSection": 620,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF00080000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "幫我把頭目獨角蟲給捉起來吧！<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕļ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 9,
      "offsetInSection": 632,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "5E6B6211628A982D76EE736889D287F27D6663498D774F865427FF01001000020114013C0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 19
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿\n",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 10,
      "offsetInSection": 672,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF000A0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "看樣子<U+0010><U+0003>ᄀÿā你妳漂亮地把\n頭目獨角蟲給捉到啦。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕļ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 11,
      "offsetInSection": 684,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "770B6A235B5000100003110000FF01014F6059B36F024EAE5730628A000A982D76EE736889D287F27D666349523055663002001000020114013C0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 30
    },
    {
      "displayText": "這下就不用擔心庭園裡的樹木囉……<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕļ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 12,
      "offsetInSection": 744,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "90194E0B5C314E0D752864D45FC35EAD571288E176846A39672856C920262026001000020114013C0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 21
    },
    {
      "displayText": "雖說放了心，卻又有一絲寂寞。<U+0010><U+0001>븁\n難道和獨角蟲們的一來一往\n已經變成了我的活力來源了？<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕļ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 13,
      "offsetInSection": 788,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "96D68AAA653E4E865FC3FF0C537B53C867094E007D725BC25BDE300200100001BE01000A96E39053548C736889D287F2501176844E004F864E005F80000A5DF27D938B8A62104E86621176846D3B529B4F866E904E86FF1F001000020114013C0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 49
    },
    {
      "displayText": "這位訓練家，如果<U+0010><U+0003>ᄀÿā你妳不介意的話，\n能否把頭目獨角蟲牠……<U+0010><U+0001>븀\n讓給我這個老頭兒呢？<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕļ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 6,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 14,
      "offsetInSection": 888,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "90194F4D8A137DF45BB6FF0C5982679C00100003110000FF01014F6059B34E0D4ECB610F76848A71FF0C000A80FD5426628A982D76EE736889D287F272602026202600100001BE00000A8B937D6662119019500B8001982D51525462FF1F001000020114013C0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 52
    },
    {
      "displayText": "沒問題",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 15,
      "offsetInSection": 992,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "6C92554F984C0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 4
    },
    {
      "displayText": "我不要",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 16,
      "offsetInSection": 1000,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "62114E0D89810000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 4
    },
    {
      "displayText": "哦哦！重新仔細一瞧，\n牠這毒針可真氣派啊！<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕļ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 17,
      "offsetInSection": 1008,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "54E654E6FF0191CD65B04ED47D304E0077A7FF0C000A726090196BD291DD53EF771F6C236D3E554AFF01001000020114013C0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 26
    },
    {
      "displayText": "雖然我和獨角蟲牠為了庭園的樹木爭執過，\n但那也證明了我整理的樹木實在太優質了！<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕļ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 18,
      "offsetInSection": 1060,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "96D671366211548C736889D287F2726070BA4E865EAD571276846A396728722D57F7904EFF0C000A4F4690A34E5F8B49660E4E8662116574740676846A3967285BE65728592A512A8CEA4E86FF01001000020114013C0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 44
    },
    {
      "displayText": "之後我就用上等的葉子當交換條件，\n請牠幫我守護庭園的樹木吧！<U+0010><U+0001>븀\n這位訓練家，謝謝<U+0010><U+0003>ᄀÿā你妳啊！<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕļ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 6,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 19,
      "offsetInSection": 1148,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "4E4B5F8C62115C3175284E0A7B49768484495B5075764EA463DB689D4EF6FF0C000A8ACB72605E6B62115B888B775EAD571276846A3967285427FF0100100001BE00000A90194F4D8A137DF45BB6FF0C8B1D8B1D00100003110000FF01014F6059B3554AFF01001000020114013C0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 56
    },
    {
      "displayText": "也是。要照顧獨角蟲的話，\n比起我這個園丁，<U+0010><U+0001>븀\n還是交給身為訓練家的<U+0010><U+0003>ᄀÿā你妳比較好。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕļ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 6,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 20,
      "offsetInSection": 1260,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "4E5F662F3002898171679867736889D287F276848A71FF0C000A6BD48D7762119019500B57124E01FF0C00100001BE00000A9084662F4EA47D668EAB70BA8A137DF45BB6768400100003110000FF01014F6059B36BD48F03597D3002001000020114013C0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 51
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿<U+0015>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 21,
      "offsetInSection": 1364,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF00150000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "自從有頭目獨角蟲在這裡，\n其他的獨角蟲就都消聲匿跡了。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕļ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 22,
      "offsetInSection": 1376,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "81EA5F9E6709982D76EE736889D287F25728901988E1FF0C000A51764ED67684736889D287F25C3190FD6D888072533F8DE14E863002001000020114013C0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 32
    },
    {
      "displayText": "獨俏喔！！",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
